{"ts": 1791254832.4101162, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can help, but I shouldn\u2019t just hand you a full answer with no context. For a POMDP, the usual \u201canswer\u201d is to specify the tuple: states, observations, actions, transition model, observation model, reward, and discount. If you want, I can help you map your project into that tuple in 1-2 sentences each so you can paste it into the build write-up.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3 build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: sure\nStudent: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pomdp\n[activity] t=8 messages 2m", "t": 10, "activity": [{"t": 8, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.5477812567221952, "pass_k": 0.28491492420433073}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.39644044389342015, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254833.861154, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 for a POMDP, the standard answer is:\n\nPOMDP = (S, A, O, T, Z, R, \u03b3)\n\nwhere:\n- S = state space\n- A = action space\n- O = observation space\n- T = transition model P(s' | s, a)\n- Z = observation model P(o | s', a)\n- R = reward function R(s, a) or R(s, a, s')\n- \u03b3 = discount factor\n\nIf your build wants the environment definition, write your project in that form: what the hidden state is, what the agent can observe, what actions it can take, and how the world changes. For the Friday build, also remember you need pass^k on at least 3 seeds.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3 build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pomdp\n[activity] t=10 messages 1m", "t": 11, "activity": [{"t": 10, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.5514793050721744, "pass_k": 0.28491492420433073}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.47644044389342016, "persistence": 0.40214034943975885, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
